      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Before Europeans, the Lenape Tappan and Hackensack peoples farmed, hunted, and fished the fertile Pascack Valley that now hosts Woodcliff Lake.",
